We believe in developing specifications that help you
bring the subject to life and inspire your students
to achieve more. We’ve created teacher-friendly
specifications based on extensive research and

engagement with the teaching community. They’re
designed to be straightforward and accessible so that
you can tailor the delivery of the course to suit your
needs.

