knowledge and understanding relevant to the
qualification and sector.  The NEA units draw on and
strengthen this learning with students applying their
learning in a practical, skills-based way. The synoptic
grids at the end of the NEA units show these synoptic
links.

More information about synoptic assessment within
this qualification can be found in section 5.2 synoptic
assessment.

