Entry requirements

Qualification
requirements

There is no requirement for students to achieve any specific qualifications before
taking this qualification.
Students must complete three units:
•	 one externally assessed unit (exam) - see the Terminal assessment below
•

two centre-assessed units (NEA)

Assessment method/
model

Unit R067 is assessed by an exam and marked by us.

You will assess the NEA units and we will moderate them.

We provide set assignments which must be used to assess the NEA units. Each set
assignment for unit R068 will be valid for 1 year.  The set assignment for R069 is
generic and will not be replaced each year, see section 6.2 for more information. The
dates for which they are live are shown on the front cover. You must make sure you
use the live assignment for students’ assessments and submit in the period in which
it is live.

You must make sure students have an entry for each series in which you intend to
submit or resubmit an NEA unit.
