6.3.4  Group working

We do not assess the skills associated with group work
in this qualification and the OCR-set assignment will not
include it. If it is necessary to use group work to make
the delivery of the assignment more manageable, you

must make sure that all practical tasks and evidence
submitted for assessment that shows the student has
met the marking criteria is entirely the individual’s own
work.

