+    "find": "Eight sources of support for a new enterprise: <strong>bank</strong> (loans, accounts, financial advice), <strong>business angel</strong> (capital plus mentoring and contacts), <strong>government</strong> (grants and guidance schemes), <strong>local council enterprise department</strong> (local premises, rates and area-specific funding), <strong>accountant</strong> (financial management and tax), <strong>solicitor</strong> (contracts and legal structure), <strong>friends and family</strong> (informal advice and support), <strong>Chamber of Commerce</strong> (networking and training), <strong>charities</strong> (mentoring and accessible support for early-stage businesses).",
